  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the clay tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the chopped carrots, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Mix well, then add the bread crumbs and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the tagine to the preheated oven and braise for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the tagine from the oven and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
